f  Chloe isn't someone who enjoys being  photographed without makeup on she tends  to look her best everywhere she goes the  18 year old got her start on TLC's Dance  Moms where she was often captured  without makeup Chloe looks much older  when she's wearing a full face of  cosmetics but seeing her in her natural  state is a reminder of just how young  she really is Chloe loves makeup and  enjoys teaching her followers all about  her skincare routine so she's not  opposed to skipping the makeup process  before shooting the video so that's why  I use brown shadows most of the time  Emma Watson grew up on the set of Harry  Potter where she was made to wear lots  of makeup according to Emma who spoke to  Vogue she suffered from acne while  shooting the fourth Harry Potter film  and had to douse herself in the  foundation this experience led Emma to  realize how important it is to go bear  face as it lets the skin breathe despite  being a model and actor emma enjoys  going barefaced whenever she can and  we're not too surprised to see that emma  looks just as beautiful with or without  makeup she's all about natural beauty  and skin care but that isn't to say that  she won't wear a full face of makeup  when attending prestigious events I  decided that I was a feminist and this  seemed uncomplicated to me  Sarah Jeffery isn't someone who steps  out of the house without any makeup on  in fact it's rare to come across a  picture of her without at least mascara  or lipstick on Sarah looks a lot younger  without makeup which isn't always the  look she's trying to convey the 23 year  old actor is well known for portraying  Princess Audrey in The Descendants  franchise she's also famous for playing  Maggie Dara on the TV series charmed  although Sarah doesn't need to wear  makeup to look like a model  she tends to leave her home looking her  very best Sarah is a vegan - who is  vocal about using cruelty-free products  according to WWD Sarah wears a lot of  makeup which is why she likes her  skincare to be natural  Audrey princess Audrey Sleeping Beauty's  daughter Meg Donnelly's stole our hearts  when she portrayed Addison in the  zombies franchise max age can be hard to  pinpoint Sienna she can go from looking  like a high school student to a blonde  bombshell in a matter of seconds meg has  a very unique look that can be  downplayed or enhanced by using makeup  alone she's got big blue eyes had popped  like crazy when contouring them with  black eyeliner the 19 year old star as a  model through and through  she isn't often showcased without makeup  on however you can see what she  naturally looks like in this audition  tape in this video meg is auditioning  for the role of Addison and she's  sporting a neutral look I'm so excited  to see well to say that Vanessa Hudgins  is a natural beauty would be an  understatement but there is a huge  difference between Vanessa with makeup  and Vanessa without makeup Vanessa  doesn't typically go out without any  makeup on were used to seeing her with  her classic Cateye look and bright red  lipstick but when you take those away  from her Vanessa goes from looking like  a famous actor to an everyday woman the  High School Musical star posted a  barefaced picture of herself on  instagram and it's here that we see that  her lashline and eyebrows are a lot  softer than we were led to believe still  fans were startled to see how radiant  Vanessa's skin was and how cute and  naturally pretty she was underneath all  that makeup miss Deneuve oh did you say  you are a baker yeah  Debbie Ryan is the gorgeous actor who  portrays the beauty queen Patty Bledel  on Netflix is insatiable obviously she  looks great with or without makeup but  the celeb redoes use makeup to hide  something she doesn't like about herself  Debby revealed that she has freckles in  real life and uses makeup to hide them  away which according to the star is  exhausting  the 26 year old actor isn't afraid to go  without any makeup on but fans have  stated that she can look unrecognizable  without the slightest smidge of eyeliner  would you recognize Debbie if she was  walking down the street sporting a bear  face tell us in the comments I might be  skinny on the outside but on the inside  I am still fatty patty Disney star  Payton list has grown up before our eyes  we've seen her without makeup on  multiple occasions especially when she  was younger but now that the star is in  her early 20s she tends to leave the  house looking her best  Payton's thick eyebrows are one of her  most recognizable traits so it might  come as a surprise to see the star  without any makeup on seeing as her  eyebrows are noticeably thinner she's  also known for her wide eyes which also  appear a lot smaller without makeup  either way Payton is a natural beauty  who would consider her everyday look to  border on natural I'm super fashion  woman faster than an airport mani-pedi  more powerful than a platinum Charge  Card just like her former Dance Moms  co-star Chloe Lucchese ACK Maddie  Ziegler isn't afraid to take off her  makeup and show the world what she  really looks like without makeup Maddie  looks like the young 17 year old that  she is however the star completely  transforms when donning on a full face  of cosmetics Maddie can go from looking  like a schoolgirl to a full-blown model  with just a few brush strokes the  transformation is mind-blowing but  doesn't take away from the fact that she  looks amazing without makeup in November  of 2019  Maddie posted a picture of herself on a  boat without any makeup on and Sheila  just like the Maddie we came to love on  Dance Moms keep watching to find out  which one of Maddie's former co-stars  looks completely different without  makeup  to wrap up my ALDC journey with the win  makeup enhances our features and brings  out the most beautiful versions of  ourselves but there's nothing like  wearing your real face out in public and  still coming off as a total bombshell  this is the case for actor and model  scindia Coleman whose natural beauty  always manages to shine through however  there's no denying that there's a huge  difference between the glammed up  zendaya  and her own natural counterparts this  picture of Scindia eating pizza isn't  the most flattering but it does remind  us that celebrities are normal people  just like the rest of us  zendaya is an adorable star who can go  from cute to stunning with the teeniest  bit of makeup I don't really care about  the situation because it just doesn't  seem safe  Maddie Ziggler's former co-star Jojo  Siva isn't known for letting her natural  self shine she has a brand to protect  after all Jojo is typically seen with a  high ponytail a large bow and  multicolored makeup it's hard to believe  that Jojo is only 16 years old sure she  might look and act young but her face is  always made up to the nines so what does  the former Dance Moms star look like in  real life well we caught a look at the  fresh-faced Jojo in the movie flirt and  she was unrecognizable if you take away  JoJo's makeup accessories and flashy  clothes  she's just an average sixteen year old  girl  just like Jojo Millie Bobbie Brown is a  16 year old superstar who is loved by  many she got her big break when she was  cast as 11 on the Netflix series  stranger things and has been in the  limelight  ever since while on the show Milly comes  off as a young preteen who doesn't care  about fashion or makeup but this isn't  the case in real life Milly loves to  dress up and wear cosmetics making her  look much older than she is it's easy to  forget that Milly is just a teenager but  there's nothing like seeing a picture of  her without any makeup on to remind us  of her age Milly is adorable whether she  wears makeup or not I like the new look  by the way it's cool thanks  Sophia Carson is so gorgeous it's hard  to imagine her any other way  luckily we don't have to because she's  one of those lucky ladies who looks  fantastic with or without makeup how  does she do it  well she spends a lot of time taking  care of her skin she wears sunblock  every single day and exfoliates and  moisturizes to keep her healthy glow  alive although we're used to seeing  Sophia all dolled up especially on her  Instagram page she told people that she  goes makeup free whenever she isn't  working but Sophia isn't the only  naturally beautiful Descendants star you  know what we should try an icebreaker  Chyna and MacLean isn't someone who  wears tons of makeup before leaving the  house she loves her natural side and  embraces it unlike Sarah Jeffery dove  Cameron and Sophia Carson Chyna's  Instagram page is full of natural  pictures of herself when China does wear  makeup she opts for a natural look and  it does wonders for her the 21 year old  actor is gorgeous and humble a little  make-up goes a long way for the star who  completely transforms whenever she dolls  herself up and that's a wrap on what  your favorite actors look like without  makeup  would you recognize them in public if  they were kicking it all naturelle tell  us in the comments and be sure to tell  us who you think looks the best without  any makeup on every single person  standing here it's just one bad  breakaway becoming somebody they never  meant to be thanks for watching the  things like and subscribe for more we'll  see you next time  [Music]

